      "question_category": "short_application",
      "stem": "Two hosts use the **OSI 7-layer reference model** to exchange structured records. One module converts integers between 32-bit big-endian/little-endian formats and specifies how a video stream is formatted before passing the data to the application protocol. Which OSI layer performs this data-formatting responsibility?",
