      "stem": "A developer switches a laptop from wired Ethernet to Wi-Fi at the Link layer of the TCP/IP stack (`Application -> Transport (TCP) -> Internet (IP) -> Link`) and asks two questions:\n1) \"Do we need to modify HTTP at the Application layer because the Link layer changed from Ethernet to Wi-Fi?\"\n2) \"When sending an HTTP request, does the Link layer attach its header first before TCP attaches the TCP header?\"\n\nWhich answer is accurate?",
