      "stem": "Router R uses connectionless datagram forwarding with the following forwarding table:\n- `Destination Host A -> Link 1`\n- `Destination Host B -> Link 2`\n- `Destination Host C -> Link 3`\n\nA packet arrives on `Link 0` with header `Source: Host X, Destination: Host B`. What does Router R do?",
