      "correct_option_id": "D",
      "answer_explanation": "Convert distance to meters: `d = 600 km × 1,000 m/km = 600,000 m = 6.0 × 10^5 m`. Divide by `s = 2.0 × 10^8 m/s`: `d_prop = (6.0 × 10^5) / (2.0 × 10^8) = 0.003 s = 3 ms`.",
