        "B": "`2 ms` uses the speed of light in a vacuum (`3.0 × 10^8 m/s`) instead of the stated fiber speed (`2.0 × 10^8 m/s`).",
        "C": "`30 ms` misplaces a power of 10 when dividing `6 × 10^5` by `2 × 10^8` (`0.03 s` instead of `0.003 s`)."
