      "correct_option_id": "D",
      "answer_explanation": "`/24` specifies that the first `24` bits (3 full octets: `192.168.50`) form the network prefix (`192.168.50.0/24`, mask `255.255.255.0`), and the trailing `32 - 24 = 8` bits (`17`) form the host portion.",
