      "correct_option_id": "A",
      "answer_explanation": "Per RFC 9293 §2.2 and `Systems Approach §5.2`, TCP provides a connection-oriented, reliable, in-order, bidirectional (full-duplex) byte-stream service to applications, using port numbers to identify services and multiplex distinct flows.",
