      "stem": "Timeline on Router `R0` for destination prefix `198.51.100.0/24`:\n- At `t = 1 s`, a routing process updates `R0`'s table from `198.51.100.0/24 via R1` to `198.51.100.0/24 via R2`.\n- At `t = 2 s`, a packet addressed to `198.51.100.14` arrives at `R0` and is sent to `R2` using the updated table.\n\nWhich sequence accurately labels the actions at `t = 1 s` and `t = 2 s`?",
