      "question_category": "short_application",
      "stem": "Host H1 has the following IPv4 configuration and empty ARP cache:\n- Local IPv4 / mask: `10.1.4.6/24` (local subnet `10.1.4.0/24`)\n- Default gateway: `10.1.4.1`\n- Packet destination: `10.1.5.9`\n\nUnder the stated `/24` next-hop rule, which IPv4 address must Host H1 resolve via ARP first?",
