      "stem": "A sender computes a 3-bit CRC remainder for message `1101` using generator `1011`:\n- Form the augmented dividend `1101000`.\n- Step 1 at index 0: `1101 XOR 1011 = 0110`, leaving active tail `110000`.\n- Continue aligned modulo-2 XOR whenever the leading active bit is `1`.\n\nWhat 3-bit remainder remains at the end of the division?",
