      "question_category": "misconception_analysis",
      "stem": "A plant proposal joins two points with two segments. Segment 1 is a 40 m run in a quiet office; segment 2 is a 600 m run through a machine hall with strong electrical noise. In the toy catalog, Copper reaches 80 m and is not approved for strong noise; Fiber reaches 800 m and is approved. The plan uses Copper for both segments. Which assessment is correct?",
