      "question_category": "misconception_analysis",
      "stem": "Host H is configured as 192.0.2.10/24 with gateway 192.0.3.1. The attached router interface is 192.0.2.1, another device on the same LAN already uses 192.0.2.10, and 192.0.2.30 is confirmed unused. A colleague says only the gateway needs repair. No proxy/on-link exception exists. Which repair set fixes both stated faults?",
